OL,3,GNEWSAIsland bracing for 'high tides' on
OL,4,Aexposed coasts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Manannan catamaran's Liverpool
OL,7,Fsailing as well as her return journey
OL,8,Fto the island has been cancelled due to
OL,9,Fforecasts of adverse weather.
OL,11,FIt comes as people brace for high tides
OL,12,Faround the island's exposed coasts as
OL,13,Fan amber warning for coastal
OL,14,Fovertopping is due to come into force
OL,15,Ffrom 10:30 GMT and ends at 13:30.
OL,17,FForecasters at Ronaldsway Met office
OL,18,Fsaid debris could spill on to Shore
OL,19,FRoad, Castletown promenade and Fenella
OL,20,FBeach and to some extent northern parts
OL,21,Fof Peel and Douglas and Laxey
OL,22,FPromenades.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
